---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';

// AFRIMMAK — Privacy Policy.
// Written to reflect the site AS IT EXISTS TODAY: the Contact form is UI-only
// (no backend), so no personal data is actually stored yet. Sections describe
// what WILL happen once a backend is wired up. See the inline {/* TODO */}
// notes below for the specific decisions that must be confirmed before this
// policy is legally solid.
const lastUpdated = 'July 2026';
---

<BaseLayout
  current=""
  title="Privacy Policy — Afrimmak"
  description="How Afrimmak handles the information you share through our website — what we collect, why, and your rights. A project of the Mendez Impact Foundation."
>
  <section class="page-head">
    <div class="afr-container">
      <div class="legal">
        <div class="eyebrow">Legal</div>
        <h1 class="legal__title">Privacy Policy</h1>
        <p class="legal__updated">Last updated: {lastUpdated}</p>

        <div class="legal__body">
          <p class="lede">
            This policy explains what information Afrimmak collects through this
            website, why we collect it, and what you can do about it. We have
            kept it plain and short, because that is the point.
          </p>

          <p>
            Afrimmak is a project of the <strong>Mendez Impact Foundation</strong>,
            based in Brusubi, West Coast Region, The Gambia. For anything in this
            policy, the Foundation is responsible for your information and is your
            point of contact.
          </p>

          {/* TODO (backend): The Contact form is currently UI-only with no
              backend, so no data is submitted or stored anywhere yet. Once the
              form is wired to a provider (Formspree or Supabase — to be
              confirmed), update the two sections below with the provider name,
              where data is stored/hosted, and any sub-processor details. */}
          <h2>Where things stand right now</h2>
          <p>
            At the moment, our Contact form is not connected to anything. It does
            not send or store your details — submitting it simply shows a notice
            on the page. So today, we are not collecting or holding any personal
            information through this site.
          </p>
          <p>
            This will change once we connect the form to a service that can
            deliver your message to us. The rest of this policy describes what
            will happen then, so you know in advance. We will update the date at
            the top when that goes live.
          </p>

          <h2>What we collect</h2>
          <p>
            Once the Contact form is live, we will collect only what the form
            actually asks for:
          </p>
          <ul>
            <li>your name;</li>
            <li>your email address;</li>
            <li>your phone or WhatsApp number, if you choose to add it (optional);</li>
            <li>the message you write to us, including the topic you select.</li>
          </ul>
          <p>
            We do not ask for anything else, and we would rather you did not put
            sensitive personal details in a message to us.
          </p>

          <h2>Why we collect it</h2>
          <p>
            To reply to you. That is it — answering questions about the
            competition, following up on partnership and funding enquiries,
            responding to media requests, and hearing from people who want to
            volunteer. We do not use your details for marketing, and we will not
            add you to a mailing list unless we add that option later and you
            clearly opt in.
          </p>

          <h2>Who sees it</h2>
          <p>
            Only the Afrimmak team, so we can respond to you. We do not sell your
            information, and we do not share it with anyone else for their own
            use.
          </p>
          {/* TODO (backend): Once a form provider is chosen, disclose that the
              provider processes and stores submissions on our behalf as a
              data processor, and link/name it here. */}
          <p>
            When the form goes live, your message will be handled on our behalf
            by the third-party service we use to run the form and deliver it to
            us. That provider will store your submission so we can read it. We
            will name the provider here once it is chosen.
          </p>

          <h2>How long we keep it</h2>
          <p>
            {/* TODO (retention): No fixed retention period has been set. This is
                a reasonable placeholder — confirm an actual period/policy. */}
            For as long as we need it to respond to you and follow up properly,
            or until you ask us to delete it — whichever comes first. If a
            conversation goes nowhere, we clear it out.
          </p>

          <h2>Your rights</h2>
          <p>
            You can ask us at any time to:
          </p>
          <ul>
            <li>tell you what information we hold about you;</li>
            <li>correct anything that is wrong;</li>
            <li>delete what we hold.</li>
          </ul>
          <p>
            Just email <a href="mailto:info@afrimmak.org">info@afrimmak.org</a>
            and we will sort it out. There is no charge for this.
          </p>

          <h2>Children's privacy</h2>
          <p>
            {/* TODO (children/age): The competition may involve students, and
                the real minimum age / handling of under-16 data is a genuine
                legal question tied to the programme's actual age range. This
                paragraph assumes a "not directed at under-16s" stance — CONFIRM
                the programme's age range and adjust before relying on this. */}
            This website is not directed at children under 16, and we do not
            knowingly collect information from them through it. If you believe a
            child has sent us their details, contact us at
            <a href="mailto:info@afrimmak.org">info@afrimmak.org</a> and we will
            remove it.
          </p>

          <h2>Analytics and third parties</h2>
          {/* TODO (analytics): There is currently NO analytics, NO cookies, and
              NO third-party tracking on the site. If Plausible, Fathom, GA4, or
              anything similar is added later, describe it here (what it
              collects, whether it uses cookies, and how to opt out). */}
          <p>
            We currently use no analytics, no cookies, and no third-party
            tracking on this site. Nothing follows you around, and nothing is
            counting your visits. If that ever changes, we will describe exactly
            what we have added, and update this section and the date above.
          </p>

          <h2>Changes to this policy</h2>
          <p>
            We may update this policy as Afrimmak grows and as the site gains new
            features — most importantly, when the Contact form goes live. When we
            do, we will change the "last updated" date at the top of this page.
          </p>

          <h2>Contact</h2>
          <p>
            Questions about your privacy, or a request about your information?
            Email <a href="mailto:info@afrimmak.org">info@afrimmak.org</a> or
            call +220 3869939. We are a real team and we will reply personally.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  .page-head { padding-top: 156px; padding-bottom: 64px; background: var(--paper); }

  .legal { max-width: 760px; margin: 0 auto; }
  .legal__title {
    font-family: var(--font-display); font-weight: 900;
    font-size: clamp(34px, 4.4vw, 52px);
    line-height: 1.06; letter-spacing: -0.02em;
    margin: 8px 0 8px;
    color: var(--ink-900);
  }
  .legal__updated {
    font-family: var(--font-body); font-size: 14px;
    color: var(--ink-500); margin: 0 0 8px;
  }

  .legal__body { margin-top: 24px; }
  .legal__body .lede { margin: 0 0 8px; }
  .legal__body h2 {
    font-family: var(--font-display); font-weight: 800;
    font-size: 22px; line-height: 1.25; letter-spacing: -0.01em;
    color: var(--ink-900);
    margin: 44px 0 12px;
  }
  .legal__body p {
    font-family: var(--font-body); font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.75;
    color: var(--ink-800); margin: 0 0 16px;
  }
  .legal__body ul {
    margin: 0 0 16px; padding-left: 22px;
    display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 8px;
  }
  .legal__body li {
    font-family: var(--font-body); font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.7;
    color: var(--ink-800);
  }
  .legal__body a { color: var(--blue-600); text-decoration: underline; text-underline-offset: 2px; }
  .legal__body a:hover { color: var(--blue-700); }
  .legal__body strong { color: var(--ink-900); }
</style>
